  "sourceText": "Blackberry Yogurt Dressing\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 20, 2009 - 11:55pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nPinch sugar\n1 bn fresh basil\n4 ounces Plain low fat yogurt\n4 ounces Apple cider\n1 Tea balsamic vinegar\n1 pch Fresh Blackberries\n4 ounces Olive oil\nPepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 LOW-CAL 22 CAL PER 1/2 OZ add 1/2 the Blackberries to the vinegar add reduce by 1/3 mix cooled reduction and yogurt mix cooled reduction and yogurt add the olive oil add chopped Blackberries",
